`benchmark.meta description: Repeated fill-and-clear of 64 scalar entries in GC and arena Maps reserved for 256.
`benchmark.meta timing: recommended
`benchmark.meta profiles: compile-timing,allocator

/core
/core/arena

. checksum = 0u64
. map = Map'U64'U64(256)
for round in 0 .. < 10000
    for index in 0 .. < 64
        map[index as U64] = (index + round) as U64
    checksum += map[7u64]!
    map.clear()
. arena = Arena()
. arena-map = Map'U64'U64(arena, 256)
for round in 0 .. < 10000
    for index in 0 .. < 64
        arena-map[index as U64] = (index + round) as U64
    checksum += arena-map[7u64]!
    arena-map.clear()
arena.release()

-- "bench-result map/clear-refill-scalar checksum=$checksum"
